{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/bbschool.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/bbschool.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_01",
      "hash64": "99E1CBDF40414064",
      "text": "歡迎來到藍莓學園！\\c\\n如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是第一次搭乘地下鐵和海中電梯\\n上學的話，那[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定很吃驚吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_02",
      "hash64": "99E1CEDF4041457D",
      "text": "恭喜[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，新冠軍！\\n居然能打贏烏栗，厲害喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_03",
      "hash64": "99E1CDDF404143CA",
      "text": "自從[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來了以後，\\n學園就變熱鬧了呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_05_01",
      "hash64": "3F0543C0D1868BE8",
      "text": "下一堂課是在\\n哪個區域上來著？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_06_01",
      "hash64": "69EFBBB58879C6FF",
      "text": "我去極地區的時候\\n要是不穿厚一點，就會感冒。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_01",
      "hash64": "568963BD3A157AAB",
      "text": "大家說的留學生就是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嗎？\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看起來一點都不強啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_01",
      "hash64": "84436BC39CF12174",
      "text": "在我們學園呀，要是寶可夢不夠強，\\n是很難混下去的喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_02",
      "hash64": "568964BD3A157C5E",
      "text": "真是人不可貌相，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢實力很強呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_02",
      "hash64": "84436EC39CF1268D",
      "text": "連杜若都甘拜下風的烏栗，\\n居然會打輸……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_03",
      "hash64": "568965BD3A157E11",
      "text": "我也想像[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳那樣\\n變得更強。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_03",
      "hash64": "84436DC39CF124DA",
      "text": "在帕底亞有很多\\n像[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這麼強的人，對吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_14_01",
      "hash64": "26976F93824E30DA",
      "text": "精靈球真是\\n有再多都不夠用呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_15_01",
      "hash64": "529E5B99E3B8138F",
      "text": "你就去藍樂活收集ＢＰ，\\n然後買些好球嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_01",
      "hash64": "570143302C7F5191",
      "text": "入口的對戰場是用來舉行\\n藍莓聯盟的官方對戰的！\\c\\n觀眾席在冠軍戰時\\n會塞滿了觀眾喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_01",
      "hash64": "7FCC3724E1A4F8FC",
      "text": "我看了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和紫竽兒的對戰喔！\\n有我從來沒見過的寶可夢呢～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_02",
      "hash64": "570140302C7F4C78",
      "text": "冠軍戰太精彩了！\\n烏栗會降為四天王嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_02",
      "hash64": "7FCC3A24E1A4FE15",
      "text": "我看了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和烏栗的對戰！\\n烏栗他……看起來很難過呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_03",
      "hash64": "570141302C7F4E2B",
      "text": "我也要把成為冠軍當做目標，\\n更加努力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_03",
      "hash64": "7FCC3924E1A4FC62",
      "text": "我看[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰，看著看著啊，\\n就變成[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的粉絲了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_26_01",
      "hash64": "26977B0B9A53D955",
      "text": "在藍莓學園，\\n雙打對戰是主流。\\c\\n……大概是因為雙打能有\\n更多元化的戰術吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_48_01",
      "hash64": "0CCDD383BC364E3D",
      "text": "試著到草原區\\n捕捉獨角犀牛吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_49_01",
      "hash64": "374C477872CE63A8",
      "text": "岩石屬性研究Ⅱ好難，\\n我就是搞不懂……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "1C17ACEE4FF1A83B",
      "text": "正電拍拍的特性是正電！\\c\\n牠和負電拍拍在一起時，\\n特攻就會變強喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_10",
      "hash64": "1C1B31EE4FF4C011",
      "text": "屬性相剋讓我頭昏腦脹，\\n所以在對戰時會忍不住看筆記。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_11",
      "hash64": "1C1B30EE4FF4BE5E",
      "text": "寒冷時花草會枯萎，\\n所以冰屬性剋草屬性！\\c\\n只要像這樣發揮想像力，\\n就會比較容易記住屬性相剋囉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_ni_npc_03",
      "hash64": "05D3C80A27AFEA1A",
      "text": "這間教室位於海中！\\c\\n因此會使用螢幕顯示天空\\n來減輕封閉感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_ni_npc_04",
      "hash64": "05D3C30A27AFE19B",
      "text": "現實世界如果是晚上，\\n巨蛋裡面也會是一片夜空。\\r\\n天色是和時間同步的喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "43A1B111E3CDBD18",
      "text": "丹瑜她呀，雖然很任性，\\n但我就是沒辦法去討厭她呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_02",
      "hash64": "43A1B411E3CDC231",
      "text": "我們班上有\\n學生會長納莉，\\r\\n還有鬧事女孩丹瑜喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_08",
      "hash64": "43A1AA11E3CDB133",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道在同一個地方一直轉圈圈，\\n就能咻～地厲害轉起來嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_09",
      "hash64": "43A1A911E3CDAF80",
      "text": "巨蛋裡面有一片\\n總是起著風的草原喔。\\r\\n在那裡轉圈圈應該會很有趣吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_ni_npc_02",
      "hash64": "4CBCFFE41455FEC0",
      "text": "有一次我走在草原時，\\n忽然感覺到有風吹來，\\r\\n然後還聽到了神秘的歌聲呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "88BF4FEFD500A857",
      "text": "我將來想要在\\n友好商店工作，\\r\\n所以正在調查當紅的道具喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_06",
      "hash64": "88BF4CEFD500A33E",
      "text": "就算沒有寶可夢的掉落物，\\n只要有ＢＰ，\\r\\n就能買到招式學習器，真方便！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_07",
      "hash64": "88BF4DEFD500A4F1",
      "text": "寶可夢的招式「幫助」！\\n在雙打對戰能大放異彩喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_09",
      "hash64": "88BF47EFD5009ABF",
      "text": "球和傷藥可以在\\n巨蛋裡面的自動販賣機購買喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_ni_npc_01",
      "hash64": "583FBDEA529D9068",
      "text": "複合金屬可以用在\\n哪種寶可夢上呢？\\r\\n像金屬一樣的寶可夢嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_03",
      "hash64": "37B4AB4CD1A6BE52",
      "text": "食堂的餐點雖然口味有點重，\\n但食力會對全屬性都有效。\\r\\n要是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有ＢＰ，就點來吃吃看吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_04",
      "hash64": "37B4A64CD1A6B5D3",
      "text": "要野餐的話，\\n當然要選峽谷區！\\r\\n而且那裡還是納莉小姐的地盤！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_05",
      "hash64": "37B4A54CD1A6B420",
      "text": "要吃三明治的話，\\n肯定就是到海岸區！\\r\\n而且那裡還有紫竽兒的廣場！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_14",
      "hash64": "37B1284CD1A3A9E2",
      "text": "要和四天王對戰，\\n得要先完成四天王挑戰才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_15",
      "hash64": "37B1294CD1A3AB95",
      "text": "我有懼高症，要我去納莉的挑戰，\\n根本是門兒都沒有啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_03",
      "hash64": "BE6E89CD48A7E7FF",
      "text": "四天王裡面，我喜歡杜若！\\n他看起來沒什麼幹勁，但卻很強喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_04",
      "hash64": "BE6E86CD48A7E2E6",
      "text": "四天王的赤松有點糊塗，\\n好可愛～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_09",
      "hash64": "BE6E93CD48A7F8FD",
      "text": "好冷好冷……\\n極地區讓我全身都冷吱吱的。\\r\\n我要吃披薩來暖和一下。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_13",
      "hash64": "BE7211CD48AB04EE",
      "text": "食堂菜單上的東西\\n全都是席藍校長愛吃的喔！\\c\\n雖然看起來營養很不均衡，\\n但食力可不是蓋的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_default_02",
      "hash64": "4838AF90CBE7C23A",
      "text": "我的無畏小子，\\n很喜歡跑步機喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_default_03",
      "hash64": "4838B090CBE7C3ED",
      "text": "我呀，會跟皮卡丘\\n一起在藍莓聯盟加油的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_gorgeous_03",
      "hash64": "0B52C2D553842AA5",
      "text": "社辦金光閃閃的！\\n喵喵很高興呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_gorgeous_04",
      "hash64": "0B52BBD553841EC0",
      "text": "喵喵豎起爪子，\\n一副蠢蠢欲動的樣子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_fancy_02",
      "hash64": "379821920A2E597E",
      "text": "幻彩裝飾的社辦！\\n紫竽兒應該會喜歡。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_02",
      "hash64": "9EF15DD9F764F7C8",
      "text": "這房間跟金屬怪……\\n感覺好搭呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_04",
      "hash64": "9EF163D9F76501FA",
      "text": "這間社辦好酷喔！\\n美術社真厲害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_06",
      "hash64": "9EF161D9F764FE94",
      "text": "那、那個該不會是\\n電影裡面的神秘圓盤吧！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_retro_02",
      "hash64": "A7536668B59027E1",
      "text": "這個房間裡有好多看起來\\n喜歡挖東西的寶可夢……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_monotone_01",
      "hash64": "31B3FBDF672CBF89",
      "text": "斑斑馬在黑白的房間裡，\\n幾乎要看不到了，好可愛喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_monotone_04",
      "hash64": "31B3FEDF672CC4A2",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道嗎？盔甲鳥的弱點很少，\\n不太好對付喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_natural_02",
      "hash64": "E9D685C1A393F632",
      "text": "社辦裡充滿了自然的氣息！\\n草寶可夢看起來也很高興！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_dark_05",
      "hash64": "2503A7FD20029400",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把社辦的主題\\n染成暗黑。\\r\\n陰陰暗暗的，我好愛……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
